"http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Tech Industry</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/28/multimedia/00xp-time-saver-promo/00xp-time-saver-promo-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image" /></item><item><title>How Jensen Huang’s Secret Led to His Downfall at Nvidia</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>Nvidia’s leader said his relationship with a female customer was just about business. But what he was concealing eventually led to his resignation from the company he created.</description><dc:creator>Tripp Mickle, Ana Swanson, Paul Mozur, Jonathan Swan, Julian E. Barnes and Maggie Haberman</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:50:17 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Artificial intelligence</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">International relations</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Spying and Intelligence Agencies</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Board of directors</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Adultery</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computer Chip</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Government Surveillance</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Megaspeed</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_geo">Ministry of State Security of the People's Republic of Chin