ang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">NVIDIA</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Startup</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computers and the Internet</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Tech Industry</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Artificial intelligence</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Venture capital</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Cloud computing</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Entrepreneurship</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computer Chip</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Anthropic</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">OpenAI</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/13/multimedia/13biz-nvidia-startups-2-mfvc/13biz-nvidia-startups-2-mfvc-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image"><media:credit>Mike Kai Chen for The New York Times</media:credit><media:description>Jensen Huang’s resignation on Thursday as chief executive of Nvidia has investors and start-up founders nervous that they have lost a powerful ally.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>Tech Leaders Rally Behind Jensen Huang</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/silicon-valley-nvidia-jensen-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/silicon-valley-nvidia-jensen-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/14/technology/silicon-valley-nvidia-jensen-huang.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>In social m